        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.15,
            0.884,
            0.197
          ],
          "content": "Does a square have only one line of symmetry? Take a square piece of paper. By folding, find all its lines of symmetry."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.275,
